<title>USA: U.S. DAP prices steady, ammonia weaker.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP prices steady, ammonia weaker.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate prices were steady on Friday while ammonia was nominally weaker, several dealers said. Rains in the U.S. Midwest disrupted wheat planting and slowed the application of ammonia, a dealer said.</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	  Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   178-180			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-185			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   215-225			dn 10</p>
